      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00066",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[66]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5138,
      "endIndex": 5188,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "1. Are joggers acceptable to wear at the airport?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00067",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[67]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5188,
      "endIndex": 5427,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Yes, absolutely. The trick is to wear tailored, premium joggers rather than old, baggy sweatpants. Our cotton joggers have a clean, tapered fit that looks completely stylish and intentional while giving you maximum comfort for the flight.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00068",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[68]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5427,
      "endIndex": 5428,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00069",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[69]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5428,
      "endIndex": 5483,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "2. Which fabric is best for packing without wrinkling?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00070",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[70]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5483,
      "endIndex": 5746,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "If you want something that looks perfect right out of the suitcase, stick to our stretch-cotton blends. However, don't be afraid to pack linen! Linen is meant to have a relaxed, slightly wrinkled textureâ€”it shows that you are wearing a premium, natural fabric.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00071",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[71]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5746,
      "endIndex": 5747,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00072",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[72]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5747,
      "endIndex": 5797,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "3. What should I wear on a hot train or bus ride?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00073",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[73]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5797,
      "endIndex": 5980,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Avoid heavy denim at all costs. Go for our lightweight [Men's Shorts](https://cottonworld.net/collections/mens-shorts) or our pure linen trousers. They promote massive airflow and will stop you from feeling sticky and claustrophobic.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00074",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[74]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5980,
      "endIndex": 5981,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00075",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[75]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5981,
      "endIndex": 6027,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "4. How can I pack lighter for a weekend trip?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00076",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[76]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6027,
      "endIndex": 6282,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The secret is versatility. Pack items that can do double duty. A crisp white cotton T-shirt can be worn on the plane, used as a base layer during the day, or paired with a nice jacket for dinner. Stick to neutral colors so everything in your bag matches.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00077",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[77]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6282,
      "endIndex": 6283,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00078",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[78]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6283,
      "endIndex": 6337,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "5. Do Cotton Bamboo shirts actually stop sweat odors?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00079",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[79]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6337,
      "endIndex": 6601,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "They do a fantastic job of managing it. Bamboo fibers are naturally breathable and wick moisture incredibly fast. Because the sweat doesn't sit trapped against your skin like it does with synthetic polyester, odor-causing bacteria have a much harder time growing.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
